$NetBSD$

Close the RTP UDP context before retrying a failed RTCP pair allocation.
Also close an unusable port65535 context and fail after bounded retry exhaustion
instead of reaching setup with no complete pair. Preserve ordinary retry behavior.
AI-assisted EmberBSD adaptation of FFmpeg9.0.2; not submitted or accepted
upstream. Original FFmpeg authorship and LGPL remain.

--- libavformat/rtpproto.c.orig
